<title>FINLAND: INTERAVANTI CLARIFIES INTERGLOBIA PRICE.</title>
<headline>INTERAVANTI CLARIFIES INTERGLOBIA PRICE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnnish real estate investment company Interavanti Oy said in a statement on Friday the price for its 25.2 percent stake in Interglobia in an earlier announced deal was 17.5 million markka.</p>
<p>The company said on Tuesday it had agreed to sell the stake to Canadian Beninco Holdings and written down the value of its Interglobia shares by six million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;The amount of shares sold is 6,046,000 and the price is 2.90 markka per share, in all about 17.5 million markka,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
